# Official docs first

When unsure of an API, prefer Cursor **@Docs** / official docs over inventing types:

| Stack | Docs |
| ----- | ---- |
| UI | ant-design-vue (antdv.com) |
| AI | ai-sdk.dev + Groq provider page |
| Vue / Pinia / VueUse | vuejs.org / pinia.vuejs.org / vueuse.org |
| Schemas | zod.dev |
| CSS utilities | tailwindcss.com (v4 CSS-first) |
| Build | vite.dev |

Always use **package TypeScript exports** at call sites — never hand-roll twins of library props/config.
